1
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:13,000
Nineteen years ago,
I bathed you with my own hands.

2
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,700
You grew up watching me lift these trophies.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
You didn't even know my name.
Now the whole world knows yours.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,400
They call this my last dance.
I never said that.

5
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,000
But if it is… I'm glad it's you.

6
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:42,300
Nineteen years…
and we're back to the beginning.

7
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:48,000
The same red. The same blue.
One last time.
